Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 23:38:40 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] docs: rename CLI, env vars and metrics to inkproof

- CLI command `verifier` -> `inkproof` (cmd/inkproof, bin/inkproof)
- Environment variables VERIFIER_* -> INKPROOF_*
- Prometheus metrics verifier_* -> inkproof_*
- Add README tagline

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DfcpiAvnQP3iKFe16imGq3
